10 REM LOGIC GARDEN 126: GURRGIYN STRIKES
20 PRINT CHR$(147) : REM CLEAR SCREEN
30 POKE 53280, 0 : POKE 53281, 0 : REM ABSOLUTE VOID

40 REM --- SPRITE POINTERS ---
50 REM 200 = MANTIS BODY    (GREEN)
60 REM 201 = ARMS FOLDED    (GREEN)
70 REM 202 = ARMS EXTENDED  (GREEN)
80 REM 203 = RED DATA NODE  (WAITING FOR ASSIMILATION)

100 REM --- VIC-II SETUP ---
110 V = 53248
120 POKE V+21, 7 : REM ENABLE SPRITES 0,1,2
130 POKE V+39, 5 : REM SPR 0 GREEN
140 POKE V+40, 5 : REM SPR 1 GREEN
150 POKE V+41, 2 : REM SPR 2 RED
160 POKE V+23, 7 : POKE V+29, 7 : REM EXPAND X & Y FOR ALL

200 REM --- INITIALIZE STATIC MANTIS ---
210 POKE 2040, 200 : REM BODY
220 POKE 2041, 201 : REM FOLDED ARMS
230 POKE 2042, 203 : REM DATA NODE
240 MX = 150 : MY = 140 : REM MANTIS X,Y
250 POKE V, MX : POKE V+1, MY     : REM PLACE BODY
260 POKE V+2, MX : POKE V+3, MY   : REM PLACE ARMS (OVERLAPPING)

300 REM --- THE DRIFT (TARGET APPROACHES) ---
310 FOR TX = 340 TO 210 STEP -2
320   REM HANDLE TARGET MSB
330   IF TX > 255 THEN POKE V+4, TX-256 : POKE V+16, 4
340   IF TX <= 255 THEN POKE V+4, TX : POKE V+16, 0
350   POKE V+5, 140 : REM TARGET Y
360   FOR D = 0 TO 5 : NEXT D : REM DRIFT SPEED
370 NEXT TX

400 REM --- THE STRIKE ($O(1)$ RESOLUTION) ---
410 POKE 2041, 202 : REM INSTANT POINTER SWAP: ARMS EXTENDED
420 FOR T = 0 TO 50 : NEXT T : REM SNAP FRAME

500 REM --- ASSIMILATION (RETRACT) ---
510 POKE 2041, 201 : REM POINTER SWAP: ARMS FOLDED
520 POKE V+16, 0   : REM CLEAR TARGET MSB
530 POKE V+4, MX+20: REM PULL TARGET INTO MANTIS (X)
540 POKE V+5, MY+10: REM PULL TARGET INTO MANTIS (Y)
550 POKE V+41, 7   : REM CHANGE TARGET COLOR TO YELLOW
560 FOR T = 0 TO 1000 : NEXT T : REM HOLD POSE

600 END
